			(description "Automotive 3-36 V input, 3.3 V fixed / 1-7 V adjustable, 1 A synchronous buck power module with integrated inductor and bootstrap capacitor, 2.2 MHz, dual random spread spectrum, QFN-FCMOD-11 (RDN). SW (5,6): no external component, no signal, minimum copper. BOOT (7): capacitor is INTERNAL, leave unconnected. VCC (8): 1 uF to GND, no external load. MODE/SYNC (11) abs max 5.5 V -- never tie to VIN. EN (2) and MODE/SYNC (11) must not float. FB (9) for fixed output connects directly to VOUT (4).")
			(docs "https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tpsm33610-q1.pdf")
			(footprints
				(fp "TPSM*RDN0011B*")
